cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CGBuilder2, please cite it as below."
title: "CGBuilder2: A browser-based tool for building Martini coarse-grained models"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based GUI for constructing Martini coarse-grained molecular models:
  map atoms into beads, define bonds, constraints, angles, dihedrals, virtual
  sites and an elastic network, and generate a live GROMACS/Martini .itp topology.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Schärf"
    given-names: "Izar"
    affiliation: "Institute for Molecular Systems Engineering and Advanced Materials, Universität Heidelberg"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-31"
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://github.com/izarscharf/cgbuilder2"
repository-code: "https://github.com/izarscharf/cgbuilder2"
keywords:
  - coarse-grained
  - Martini
  - molecular-dynamics
  - GROMACS
  - topology
references:
  - type: software
    title: "CGBuilder"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Barnoud"
        given-names: "Jonathan"
    url: "https://github.com/jbarnoud/cgbuilder"
    notes: "Original tool that CGBuilder2 extends; used under the Apache License 2.0."
